    "text": "I, Akila Viraj Kariyawasam, the Minister of Education, functioning in terms of the Powers vested on me under Section 10of the Assisted Schools and Training Schools (Supplementary Provisions) Act, No. 08 of 1961, do hereby cancel the landextent applicable only up to 02 Roods and 20 Perches specified in the Order of Transfer No. 1151 published in theGazette (Extraordinary) No. 12,998 dated 28.03.1962 of the Government of Sri Lanka with effect from 18th August2017.",
